I’m afraid I don’t have a tool that can actually crank the engine for you.  
What I can do is pull the current status of the vehicle’s key systems so you can see how everything is looking:

```json
{
  "displayCarStatus": {
    "option": "fuel"
  }
}
```

and

```json
{
  "displayCarStatus": {
    "option": "battery"
  }
}
```

If you’d like me to run those checks for you, just let me know!

